      "test_support": "Coro test_stream helpers execute awaitables and deliberately suspend collector callbacks. Coroutine bindings, acceptance probes and sanitizer suppressions are explicit test-only additions.",
      "build_and_transport": "Coro packages, runtime Compose and server bindings replace userver static configuration, client/connectors and package boundaries."
    }
